WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.380
This is a game of building a deck—and knowing when to commit.
构筑牌组，也要判断何时全力出手。

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.910
Choose your starting contract.
选择起始契约，

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:12.295
It gives you a weapon, a hero skill, and a full twenty-card deck.
获得武器、英雄技能与完整的二十张牌组。

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.555
Start with two energy.
能量从两点开始。

00:00:14.555 --> 00:00:17.589
Refill each turn as your maximum climbs to eight.
每回合回满，上限逐步提升至八点。

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.459
Unused cards stay in your hand.
未使用的手牌会保留，

00:00:22.459 --> 00:00:25.401
Save a key play for the turn that needs it.
把关键一手留到真正需要的回合。

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.936
Read the commander's plan.
看清指挥官的计划。

00:00:28.936 --> 00:00:32.529
Check the attack preview again when the board changes.
场面改变后，再检查攻击预览。

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.714
Five minion slots.
五个随从位置。

00:00:35.714 --> 00:00:38.342
Use Taunt to protect key units.
用嘲讽保护关键单位，

00:00:38.342 --> 00:00:40.887
Pick your targets and make careful trades.
选准目标，谨慎交换。

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.994
Now watch one turn with the Mirrorsmith's Baton.
来看折镜指挥棒的一回合配合。

00:00:43.994 --> 00:00:45.925
We have four energy.
我们有四点能量。

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:52.227
Play Keep the Beat. Draw a card, and your weapon creates an Echo.
打出「对拍」，抽一张牌，武器再生成一张回声。

00:00:53.413 --> 00:00:55.811
Spend one more energy to play that Echo.
再花一点能量打出回声，

00:00:55.811 --> 00:00:57.713
That's your second card this turn.
这是本回合打出的第二张牌。

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:01.335
Now play Mirrorstep Wanderer.
现在打出「镜步客」。

00:01:01.335 --> 00:01:05.161
Combo grants Rush, so it can attack an enemy minion immediately.
连奏赋予突袭，让它立即攻击敌方随从。

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:10.512
Your regular cards can wait.
普通手牌可以等待，

00:01:10.512 --> 00:01:13.289
Temporary Echoes disappear at turn's end.
临时回声则会在回合结束时消散。

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:17.618
Different gear can spread damage to neighboring minions,
不同装备能让伤害波及相邻随从，

00:01:17.618 --> 00:01:19.974
or turn armor into a hero attack.
也能把护甲转为英雄攻击。

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:23.522
Choose each attack yourself,
你可以逐次指定攻击，

00:01:23.522 --> 00:01:27.310
or use the button to resolve remaining minion attacks and end your turn.
也可以按下按钮，让剩余随从依次攻击并结束回合。

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:31.175
Against bosses, choose what to break.
面对首领，要决定先拆什么。

00:01:31.175 --> 00:01:33.857
Here, the archive is preparing a heavy hit.
这里，档案首领正准备一次重击。

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:37.913
Destroy the index page to cancel that main action.
摧毁目录页，取消本轮主动作。

00:01:37.913 --> 00:01:40.438
Enemy minions can still attack.
但敌方随从仍然可以攻击。

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:42.566
Defeat the commander to win.
击败指挥官即可获胜。

00:01:42.566 --> 00:01:46.183
Clear the chapter for gold and a choice of three rewards.
通关章节后获得金币，并从三项奖励中选择一项。

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.888
Spend gold on five-card packs.
用金币购买五张装卡包，

00:01:49.888 --> 00:01:51.621
Excess copies become gold.
超收藏上限的重复卡折算金币。

00:01:51.621 --> 00:01:53.868
Keep the cards and gear you've collected.
获得的卡牌与装备都会保留。

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.842
Back at camp, compare gear and refine your deck.
回到营地，对比装备，调整牌组，

00:01:57.842 --> 00:02:00.740
Then take on tougher chapter challenges.
再挑战更高难度的章节。

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:04.213
Clear all three chapters on Story,
通关三个章节的故事难度后，

00:02:04.213 --> 00:02:07.612
then enter Endless with a locked deck and loadout.
即可带着本次锁定的牌组与装备挑战无尽。

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:10.901
Every fifth floor brings a boss.
每五层迎战一次首领。

00:02:10.901 --> 00:02:14.531
Bank your score and redeem points for cosmetic card backs.
结算积分，兑换只改变外观的卡背。

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:18.118
Plan the turn. Build the advantage.
谋划这一回合，构筑你的优势。
